steam-arm-setup (2.3.2) stable; urgency=low

  * Proton titles on Raspberry Pi GPUs use WineD3D by default; DXVK
    cannot run on V3D. Title setting d3d=dxvk switches one title back.
  * Raspberry Pi GPUs: OpenGL version report (glver) and experimental
    Zink (gl=zink) per title, off by default; settings menu Graphics,
    Route per game. Windows titles on ARM64 Proton get them as Steam
    launch option, removed again with setting or at uninstall; own
    launch options kept byte for byte.
  * Setup refreshes header comment of /etc/steam-arm/titles.conf;
    title lines kept.
  * Raspberry Pi behaviour untested on Raspberry Pi hardware.

